{"ticker":"PIDILITIND","symbol":"PIDILITIND","instrumentId":3022562,"name":"Pidilite Industries","industry":"NSE-Chemicals-Specialty","about":"Pidilite Industries Ltd. is a renowned Indian company, specializing in adhesives, sealants, construction chemicals, and art materials. The company operates through two main segments: Consumer & Bazaar Products and Business to Business (B2B). The Consumer & Bazaar segment offers popular products like Fevicol, M-Seal, and Dr. Fixit, which cater to household, DIY, and small business needs. The B2B segment serves industries with adhesives, synthetic resins, organic pigments, and construction chemicals. With a strong focus on innovation and quality, Pidilite has expanded its reach to international markets, becoming a trusted name in both household and industrial adhesive solutions across geographies.","website":"www.pidilite.com","location":"Mumbai, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:48:51.990Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":1580.5,"changePct":3.2871520062736868,"week52High":1701.5,"week52Low":1273.6},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹1,60,980 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹16,142 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"315,747,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"925"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"220,291,678"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.73%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"14.85"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.03"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.05"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"18%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"59.94"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"61–116"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"22.6%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"27.79"},{"label":"Volume","value":"1,094,185"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"744,115"},{"label":"Master score","value":"57"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"73"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"64"},{"label":"Group rank","value":